  "content": "\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n[![ko-fi](https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg)](https://ko-fi.com/L4L11C7LZ0)\n\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2ddf30b9cd8ee767153bc37f74039ae819701a3a.png\" alt=\"Title\" />\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/66dc45149d75e3f715d7ccd78a6baa0072976742.gif\" alt=\"Rollin' Around at the Speed of Sound\" />\n</div>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1 align=\"Left\">鐵軌滑行</h1>\n<h3 align=\"Left\">此模組新增了透過<b><i>鐵軌滑行</i></b>在<b><i>火車軌道</i></b>上<b><i>騎乘</i></b>的功能</h3>\n<p>高度可自訂的模組，完全支援任何版本的 Steam n' Rails，並完整支援 Sable，讓您在飛行船上也能於軌道上滑行。軌道騎乘採用慣性機制，即使使用翼鞘或其他模組的位移道具時也能維持速度。穿越維度時（包括 Create 模組支援的模組化傳送門）滑行狀態依然會持續。</p>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<div align=\"right\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1245f66fa24b169d00efad039d43210dc17f903c.png\" alt=\"misc\" />\n</div>\n\n<H1>如何開始滑行鐵軌</H1>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3f82ded5f71f1df82b435f791d7d24e4165eed16.png\" alt=\"How To Railgrind\"/>\n</div>\n<br>\n<p>裝備潛水靴即可獲得滑行鐵軌的能力。</p>\n<p>您可以為任何靴子附魔 <i>「軌道騎士」</i>，使其具備鐵軌滑行能力。</p>\n<p>控制鍵設定可在設定檔中微調。</p>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<H1>巧克力棒版本新功能！</H1>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/910d45f35925d7ce727eb322fbbd8532eded9dbd.png\" alt=\"Chocolate New Features\" />\n</div>\n<br>\n<p>巧克力棒終於派上用場了！能為您提供額外的速度與平衡加成！</p>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<H1>完全相容於 Aeronautics Contraptions 與其他模組的鐵軌</H1>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d4696a882f5fbfe67f0b637d0c950b35b3fddaae.png\" alt=\"Compatable with Addons\" />\n</div>",
